  "body": "Transform your dreams into reality with this large Section, offering the perfect space for your ideal home! Positioned to capture abundant sunlight and breathtaking distant sea views to the north, this exceptional freehold section guarantees unparalleled privacy and the exciting potential to live entirely off-grid. It's your ultimate escape from the hustle and bustle of everyday life.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n- Enjoy the benefits of the land's north-facing aspect, allowing for sun-drenched living spaces and energy-efficient designs.\r\n- The owner has invested significantly in essential services: \r\n  - 3-phase power and bore water are already in place-only a septic system installation is needed to get you started (quote available).\r\n- Driveway and passing lane are completed, ready for your vision.\r\n- Elegant house plans are available for purchase, or feel free to bring your own design!\r\n\r\nWhether you wish to build a substantial family estate, a cozy retreat, or a modern masterpiece, this property offers limitless potential. Imagine a luxurious pool, a spacious shed for your hobbies or water toys, and ample room to spread out!\r\n\r\nConveniently located close to all amenities on the Whangaparaoa Peninsula-including shops, a local supermarket, and great schools-this location is a true coastal paradise. Enjoy outdoor activities in Shakespeare Regional Park, sun-soaked days at the nearby beaches, and easy access to Gulf Harbour Marina for boating enthusiasts.\r\n\r\nThis slice of paradise won't last long-owners are motivated, have moved on, and are open to offers! Seize this unique chance to create your dream lifestyle today. Bring your offer now!\r\nDare to dream with this slice of paradise! Owners have moved on and are open to offers!  - Bring your offer today",
